

<div class="container">
<h1>Mensagens Espírituais</h1>

Receba diariamente, via SMS, uma <strong>frase inspiradora</strong> de figuras como Chico Xavier, André Luiz e Emmanuel.
<br><br>
<strong>Totalmente gratuito!</strong>

<hr/>

<% if flash[:alert] %>
  <div class="alert">
    <%= flash[:alert] %>
  </div>
<% end %>

<%= form_with url: "/subscribe", method: :post, data: { turbo: false } do |form| %>
  <div>
    <%= form.label :ddi, "DDI" %>
    <%= form.text_field :ddi, value: "55", required: true %>
  </div>

  <div>
    <%= form.label :ddd, "DDD" %>
    <%= form.text_field :ddd, placeholder: "14", required: true %>
  </div>

  <div>
    <%= form.label :number, "Número" %>
    <%= form.text_field :number, placeholder: "981186243", required: true %>
    <div
  class="cf-turnstile"
  data-sitekey="<%= ENV.fetch("CLOUDFLARE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY") %>">
</div>
  </div>  
  
  <script
  src="https://challenges.cloudflare.com/turnstile/v0/api.js"
  async
  defer>
</script>

  <%= form.submit "Cadastrar" %>
<% end %>
</div>